","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-be33f79be9dfc3ff2925","layer":"original","quote":"柔表请告者名，帝大怒曰：“刘龟当死，乃敢猎吾禁地！送龟廷尉，廷尉便当考掠〖36〗；何复请告者主名，吾岂妄收龟邪？”","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hancui-q-9a31b94eb28301d9042e","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-93972e5d29f582fc5218","layer":"original","quote":"柔曰：“廷尉，天下之平也，安得以至尊喜怒而毁法乎？”重复为奏，辞指深切；帝意悟，乃下京名。即还讯，各当其罪。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
